---
layout: layout.njk
title: "Inertial Types Database"
---

<div class="row justify-content-center">
    <div class="col-lg-10">
        <h1 class="display-5">Inertial Types Database</h1>
        <p class="text-muted">This database contains tables of inertial types of elliptic curves over \(p\)-adic fields having potentially good reduction. We currently have tables over the following fields (according to their LMFDB labels). For further computations, see our <a href="https://github.com/3nr1c/inertial-types" target="_blank">github repo</a>. The labeling of the types is in development phase and may change several times in the near future.</p>
    </div>
</div>


<div class="row justify-content-center">
    <div class="col-lg-11">
        
        {# Group by first character #}
        {% set groupedFields = fields | dictsort | groupby("1.label.0") %}

        {% for char, entries in groupedFields %}
            <section class="mb-5">
                <h2 class="h4 mb-3 text-secondary border-bottom pb-2 fw-bold">p = {{ char }}</h2>
                
                <div class="list-group list-group-flush shadow-sm rounded border">
                    {# Sort by the custom degree logic #}
                    {% for item in entries | sortByDegree %}
                        {% set field = item[1] %}

                        <div class="list-group-item list-group-item-action d-flex align-items-center py-3">
                            
                            <div style="min-width: 140px;">
                                <a href="{{ project.baseurl }}fields/{{ field.label | slugify }}/" class="fs-5 fw-bold text-decoration-none text-primary">
                                    {{ field.label }}
                                </a>
                            </div>

                            <div class="flex-grow-0 me-3">
                                <span class="badge bg-light text-dark border rounded-pill fs-6 fw-normal px-3">
                                    \( {{ field.polynomial | formatMath }} \)
                                </span>
                            </div>

                        </div>
                    {% endfor %}
                </div>
            </section>
        {% endfor %}
        
    </div>
</div>